---
// Layout and artwork transcribed from the rendered x.ai/bot page.
---

<section id="faqs">
  <div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[var(--site-content-width)] gap-10 px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
    <h2 class="lg:sticky lg:top-8 lg:self-start font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl">
      FAQs
    </h2>
    <div class="divide-border border-border divide-y border-b">
      <div>
        <h3 class="m-0 text-base font-normal">
          <button
            aria-controls="_r_t2_-0-panel"
            aria-expanded="true"
            class="focus-visible:ring-primary/30 flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
            id="_r_t2_-0-button"
            type="button"
          >
            <span class="text-primary text-base font-medium leading-6">What is Miko Agent?</span>
            <svg
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="text-primary/60 mt-0.5 size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 rotate-45"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
            >
              <path d="M10 4v12M4 10h12"></path>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          aria-labelledby="_r_t2_-0-button"
          class="overflow-hidden"
          id="_r_t2_-0-panel"
          role="region"
          style="height: auto; opacity: 1;"
        >
          <div class="text-primary max-w-2xl pr-11 pb-6 text-base leading-7 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3 [&amp;_a]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary">
            <p>A self-hosted background coding agent that connects your tools to coding agents and returns work for you to review.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="m-0 text-base font-normal">
          <button
            aria-controls="_r_t2_-1-panel"
            aria-expanded="false"
            class="focus-visible:ring-primary/30 flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
            id="_r_t2_-1-button"
            type="button"
          >
            <span class="text-primary text-base font-medium leading-6">Which coding agents can I use?</span>
            <svg
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="text-primary/60 mt-0.5 size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
            >
              <path d="M10 4v12M4 10h12"></path>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          aria-labelledby="_r_t2_-1-button"
          class="overflow-hidden"
          id="_r_t2_-1-panel"
          inert=""
          role="region"
          style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"
        >
          <div class="text-primary max-w-2xl pr-11 pb-6 text-base leading-7 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3 [&amp;_a]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary">
            <p>Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini, and OpenCode. Configure your runner and model with supported provider credentials.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="m-0 text-base font-normal">
          <button
            aria-controls="_r_t2_-2-panel"
            aria-expanded="false"
            class="focus-visible:ring-primary/30 flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
            id="_r_t2_-2-button"
            type="button"
          >
            <span class="text-primary text-base font-medium leading-6">How do I start?</span>
            <svg
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="text-primary/60 mt-0.5 size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
            >
              <path d="M10 4v12M4 10h12"></path>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          aria-labelledby="_r_t2_-2-button"
          class="overflow-hidden"
          id="_r_t2_-2-panel"
          inert=""
          role="region"
          style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"
        >
          <div class="text-primary max-w-2xl pr-11 pb-6 text-base leading-7 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3 [&amp;_a]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary">
            <p>Add the setup skills with npx skills add nexmoe/atmiko -g, then run /atmiko-setup in your coding agent. It guides installation and connections.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="m-0 text-base font-normal">
          <button
            aria-controls="_r_t2_-3-panel"
            aria-expanded="false"
            class="focus-visible:ring-primary/30 flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
            id="_r_t2_-3-button"
            type="button"
          >
            <span class="text-primary text-base font-medium leading-6">Where do I give it work?</span>
            <svg
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="text-primary/60 mt-0.5 size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
            >
              <path d="M10 4v12M4 10h12"></path>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          aria-labelledby="_r_t2_-3-button"
          class="overflow-hidden"
          id="_r_t2_-3-panel"
          inert=""
          role="region"
          style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"
        >
          <div class="text-primary max-w-2xl pr-11 pb-6 text-base leading-7 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3 [&amp;_a]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary">
            <p>Assign a Linear issue to Miko, or @Miko in a GitHub PR, GitLab MR, or Slack conversation. Connect each integration during setup; use the bot handle you configured.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="m-0 text-base font-normal">
          <button
            aria-controls="_r_t2_-4-panel"
            aria-expanded="false"
            class="focus-visible:ring-primary/30 flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
            id="_r_t2_-4-button"
            type="button"
          >
            <span class="text-primary text-base font-medium leading-6">How is model usage paid for?</span>
            <svg
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="text-primary/60 mt-0.5 size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
            >
              <path d="M10 4v12M4 10h12"></path>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          aria-labelledby="_r_t2_-4-button"
          class="overflow-hidden"
          id="_r_t2_-4-panel"
          inert=""
          role="region"
          style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"
        >
          <div class="text-primary max-w-2xl pr-11 pb-6 text-base leading-7 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3 [&amp;_a]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary">
            <p>Bring your own supported API credentials or subscription authentication. Provider usage and hosting costs are yours. The source is Apache 2.0.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="m-0 text-base font-normal">
          <button
            aria-controls="_r_t2_-5-panel"
            aria-expanded="false"
            class="focus-visible:ring-primary/30 flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
            id="_r_t2_-5-button"
            type="button"
          >
            <span class="text-primary text-base font-medium leading-6">How are tasks separated?</span>
            <svg
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="text-primary/60 mt-0.5 size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
            >
              <path d="M10 4v12M4 10h12"></path>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          aria-labelledby="_r_t2_-5-button"
          class="overflow-hidden"
          id="_r_t2_-5-panel"
          inert=""
          role="region"
          style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"
        >
          <div class="text-primary max-w-2xl pr-11 pb-6 text-base leading-7 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3 [&amp;_a]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary">
            <p>Tasks run in separate Git worktrees. Repository routing sends work to the configured repository, keeping working directories apart.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="m-0 text-base font-normal">
          <button
            aria-controls="_r_t2_-6-panel"
            aria-expanded="false"
            class="focus-visible:ring-primary/30 flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
            id="_r_t2_-6-button"
            type="button"
          >
            <span class="text-primary text-base font-medium leading-6">Where does my code run?</span>
            <svg
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="text-primary/60 mt-0.5 size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
            >
              <path d="M10 4v12M4 10h12"></path>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          aria-labelledby="_r_t2_-6-button"
          class="overflow-hidden"
          id="_r_t2_-6-panel"
          inert=""
          role="region"
          style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"
        >
          <div class="text-primary max-w-2xl pr-11 pb-6 text-base leading-7 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3 [&amp;_a]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary">
            <p>On your machine or server. The selected coding provider processes requests under your configured account. Follow tasks and searchable logs on the local status board.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
